# Pairs with ChainFrontierMonotonic. The provenance frontier that regresses:
# an increment takes its cut from its own delta alone, so an increment that
# saw no writes - or only a peer's writes stamped below the base's frontier -
# carries the chain's frontier backwards.
MODULE: ChainFrontierMonotonicNoClamp
TARGET: ChainFrontierMonotonic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an increment's cut is its delta's high-water, not clamped to its base's
PERTURBS: CaptureIncremental

--- FIND
                                  cut |-> IF high < last.cut THEN last.cut ELSE high,
--- REPLACE
                                  \* MUTATION: no clamp to the base.
                                  cut |-> high,
--- END
